WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.467 --> 00:00:02.468
-Good evening I'm Seth Meyers.
This is "Late Night."

00:00:02.468 --> 00:00:03.936
We hope you're doing all right.

00:00:03.936 --> 00:00:05.171
And now, if you don't mind,
we're going to get to the news.

00:00:05.171 --> 00:00:08.474
President Biden appeared
last night on "60 Minutes"

00:00:08.474 --> 00:00:11.444
and spoke about the ongoing war
between Israel and Hamas.

00:00:11.444 --> 00:00:13.212
And you could tell
he was nervous

00:00:13.212 --> 00:00:18.050
because he kept asking,
"How many more minutes?"

00:00:18.050 --> 00:00:20.386
The Senate returned this week
from a fall recess.

00:00:20.386 --> 00:00:25.492
Unfortunately, the House
is still in detention.

00:00:25.492 --> 00:00:26.759
House Republicans on Friday

00:00:26.759 --> 00:00:28.595
picked Ohio Congressman
Jim Jordan

00:00:28.595 --> 00:00:30.497
to be their nominee
for speaker of the House.

00:00:30.497 --> 00:00:36.235
The vote was 81 "no"
and 124, "Yeah, fine."

00:00:36.235 --> 00:00:38.104
Republican Congressman
Jorge Santos

00:00:38.104 --> 00:00:40.506
reportedly got into
a screaming match on Thursday

00:00:40.506 --> 00:00:42.375
with an activist
at the Capitol

00:00:42.375 --> 00:00:45.578
while holding
a two month old baby.

00:00:45.578 --> 00:00:47.881
So finally,
he's actually representing

00:00:47.881 --> 00:00:49.849
the people
of Long Island.

00:00:52.385 --> 00:00:55.521
Currently-indicted Republican
Congressman Jorge Santos

00:00:55.521 --> 00:00:57.824
was seen leaving
a colleague's office

00:00:57.824 --> 00:01:00.226
carrying a mysterious baby,

00:01:00.226 --> 00:01:02.494
and when he was asked
if the baby was his,

00:01:02.494 --> 00:01:06.465
he replied, "Not yet."

00:01:06.465 --> 00:01:10.603
Which brings us to a segment
called, "Okay, but for real,

00:01:10.603 --> 00:01:13.306
someone's got eyes
on this baby, right?"

00:01:13.306 --> 00:01:17.777 line:0%
♪♪

00:01:17.777 --> 00:01:21.280
Look, I know there's a lot going
on in the House right now,

00:01:21.280 --> 00:01:22.614
what with the no speaker

00:01:22.614 --> 00:01:25.118
and the nomination of election
denying insurrectionists.

00:01:25.118 --> 00:01:28.487
But for real, someone's got eyes
on this baby, right?

00:01:28.487 --> 00:01:30.189
Because I don't know
what's happening in this photo,

00:01:30.189 --> 00:01:32.625
I just know it's not good.

00:01:32.625 --> 00:01:35.160
Jorge Santos is currently
under indictment for 23 crimes,

00:01:35.160 --> 00:01:37.029
and by the look of this picture,
he's going for 24.

00:01:37.029 --> 00:01:41.734
I mean, the man's running like
he just intercepted a football.

00:01:41.734 --> 00:01:43.269
And then when asked
if the baby was his,

00:01:43.269 --> 00:01:47.873
Santos opted for the most
dramatic possible answer.

00:01:47.873 --> 00:01:50.509
"Not yet."

00:01:50.509 --> 00:01:54.614
Is he a congressman or
a "Days of Our Lives" villain?

00:01:54.614 --> 00:01:56.749
What does "not yet" mean?
Is he going to adopt it,

00:01:56.749 --> 00:01:59.819
or is he going to do away
with the parents?

00:01:59.819 --> 00:02:01.220
Someone please send me a picture

00:02:01.220 --> 00:02:02.621
of this baby
holding today's paper,

00:02:02.621 --> 00:02:05.658
because right now
I'm very concerned.

00:02:05.658 --> 00:02:07.426
But at least now we know
Jorge Santos

00:02:07.426 --> 00:02:09.595
isn't the craziest person
on Capitol Hill.

00:02:09.595 --> 00:02:14.267
That title goes to whoever
voluntarily handed a baby

00:02:14.267 --> 00:02:16.902
to Jorge Santos.

00:02:16.902 --> 00:02:18.037
-This has been...

00:02:21.140 --> 00:02:23.409
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:23.409 --> 00:02:27.547
-The CEO of the movie theater
chain AMC posted last week

00:02:27.547 --> 00:02:29.248
that a blackmailer
had catfished him

00:02:29.248 --> 00:02:30.983
and attempted
to extort him for money.

00:02:30.983 --> 00:02:32.284
"I know the feeling,"

00:02:32.284 --> 00:02:36.156
said someone who just paid $40
for popcorn and a drink.

00:02:40.626 --> 00:02:42.395
A woman in Australia
is recovering

00:02:42.395 --> 00:02:45.498
after she tried to rescue
a platypus with her bare hands,

00:02:45.498 --> 00:02:48.567
and was stabbed
with its poisonous spurs.

00:02:48.567 --> 00:02:49.902
Though in her defense,

00:02:49.902 --> 00:02:54.374
even the platypus
didn't know it could do that.

00:02:54.374 --> 00:02:59.879
"Damn, I truly am weird as hell.

00:02:59.879 --> 00:03:05.384
Every day, I learn
a new crazy fact about me.

00:03:05.384 --> 00:03:07.854
Oh, I just laid an egg."

00:03:12.024 --> 00:03:15.361
And finally, Netflix recently
unveiled plans to open two

00:03:15.361 --> 00:03:18.431
so-called Netflix House venues
where customers can eat, drink,

00:03:18.431 --> 00:03:20.066
and buy merchandise,
or more likely,

00:03:20.066 --> 00:03:23.302
just look at the menu
for two hours and leave.

00:03:23.302 --> 00:03:24.503
And that was a monologue,
everybody.

00:03:24.503 --> 00:03:26.739
We're up and running.

